inders for daily routines\n• Prepare a custom message\n\nThe return-home timer continues while the phone is locked. When the timer ends, CareButtons presents clear options to confirm the user is home, request help or add another 15 minutes.\n\nMedication and daily reminders use local iPhone notifications. Users can mark reminders as Taken, Done, Later or Skipped, and their selection remains visible when the screen is reopened.\n\nThe Activity Log provides a simple record of actions completed within the app.\n\nCareButtons supports VoiceOver and Voice Control and uses large text, clear labels, high-contrast controls and senior-friendly layouts.\n\nPrivacy and access:\n\n• Information is stored locally on the device\n• No account is required\n• No advertising or tracking\n• No external backend\n• One-time App Store purchase with full access to the current features\n\nCareButtons is a convenience notification and family reassurance tool. It is not an emergency-response service, medical device, clinical monitoring service, professional caregiving service or substitute for emergency services or medical advice.", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "9903104", "formattedPrice": "￦7,700", "trackContentRating": "4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "userRatingCount": 0}]}